<view wx:if="{{view === 'home'}}" class="home-screen">
  <view class="home-glow"></view>
  <view class="home-top"><text class="home-mark">盘古遗念 · 混沌纪</text><button class="settings-button" bindtap="openSettings">⚙</button></view>
  <view class="home-title-wrap"><text class="home-eyebrow">天地重归混沌</text><text class="home-title">开天一念</text><text class="home-subtitle">一念开天 · 万物新生</text><view class="title-rule"><view></view></view><text class="home-story">盘古神念于混沌中苏醒。四象镇守天地，天道阻断开天之路。\n再一次，你将如何开辟世界？</text></view>
  <view class="home-menu"><button class="start-button" bindtap="openIntro"><text>开始游玩</text><text class="start-arrow">›</text></button><button class="menu-button" bindtap="openSettings">设置</button><view class="home-version">东方玄幻 · 动作肉鸽</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{showSettings}}" class="settings-shade" catchtap="closeSettings"><view class="settings-card" catchtap="stopTap"><text class="settings-title">游戏设置</text><view class="setting-row"><text>音效</text><switch checked="{{soundOn}}" color="#d6b66c" bindchange="toggleSound" /></view><view class="setting-row"><text>震动反馈</text><switch checked="{{vibrationOn}}" color="#d6b66c" bindchange="toggleVibration" /></view><view class="setting-row"><text>操作提示</text><switch checked="{{hintsOn}}" color="#d6b66c" bindchange="toggleHints" /></view><button class="settings-done" bindtap="closeSettings">完成</button></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{showIntro}}" class="intro-shade"><view class="intro-card"><text class="intro-kicker">序章 · 混沌初醒</text><text class="intro-title">天地重归混沌</text><scroll-view class="intro-scroll" scroll-y="true"><text class="intro-paragraph">远古之时，盘古开天辟地，以身化作天地万物。岁月流转，众生繁衍，修行者追逐大道，圣人执掌法则。</text><text class="intro-paragraph">后来，圣人之间的争斗席卷天地。神通撕裂山河，至宝震碎星辰，旧世界的根基终于无法支撑。天道降下无量量劫，将万物重新归于混沌，试图阻止崩坏继续蔓延。</text><text class="intro-paragraph">盘古陨落之后留下的一道神念，感知到天地重归混沌，在无边寂静中再度苏醒。它忘却了漫长岁月，只记得心底仍有一件事未曾完成。</text><text class="intro-paragraph">青龙、白虎、朱雀、玄武——盘古四肢所化的四象，厌倦了天地一次次陷入争斗，受天道之命镇守混沌四方，阻止任何存在重开天地。</text><text class="intro-paragraph">击败四象，直面天道。若你能重演地火风水，便可再开天地。至于新世界将走向何方，将由万物自己书写。</text></scroll-view><button class="intro-enter" bindtap="beginGame">踏入混沌</button><button class="intro-back" bindtap="closeIntro">返回</button></view></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{view === 'game'}}" class="screen">
  <view class="topbar">
    <view><text class="brand">开天一念</text><text class="subtitle">盘古遗念 · 混沌试炼</text></view>
    <view class="stats"><text>❤ {{hp}}</text><text>境界 {{level}}</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{progress}}%"></view></view>
  <view class="arena" catchtouchstart="onTouchStart" catchtouchmove="onTouchMove" catchtouchend="onTouchEnd">
    <view class="arena-title">{{stageName}}</view>
    <view class="hint">拖动屏幕任意位置移动 · 至宝自动攻击</view>
    <view wx:for="{{enemies}}" wx:key="id" class="enemy {{item.boss ? 'boss' : ''}}" style="left:{{item.x}}%;top:{{item.y}}%">
      <text>{{item.icon}}</text><view class="enemy-hp"><view style="width:{{item.hpPct}}%"></view></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{effects}}" wx:key="id" class="effect" style="left:{{item.x}}%;top:{{item.y}}%">{{item.icon}}</view>
    <view class="player" style="left:{{player.x}}%;top:{{player.y}}%">☯</view>
    <view class="weapon-badge">{{weaponName}} · {{elementName}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="toast">{{message}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{showChoice}}" class="overlay">
      <view class="choice-panel"><text class="choice-title">灵光一现 · 选择提升</text>
        <view wx:for="{{choices}}" wx:key="id" class="choice" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseUpgrade"><text class="choice-icon">{{item.icon}}</text><view><text class="choice-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="choice-desc">{{item.desc}}</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ended}}" class="overlay"><view class="choice-panel ending"><text class="choice-title">{{endingTitle}}</text><text class="ending-copy">{{endingCopy}}</text><button class="restart" bindtap="restart">再入混沌</button></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="bottom"><view class="xp-label"><text>灵气</text><text>{{xp}} / {{xpNeed}}</text></view><view class="xp-track"><view class="xp-fill" style="width:{{xpPct}}%"></view></view><view class="bottom-row"><text>法宝：{{weaponName}}</text><text>劫境 {{stage > 4 ? 4 : stage}} / 4</text><button class="dash" bindtap="dash">遁光</button></view></view>
</view>



